Package: myway
Version: 1.0.2-3
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Chuck Talk <chuck@nordheim.online>
Section: video
Priority: optional
License: AGPL-3.0
Description: MyWay Linux Screen Recorder
 A Wayland-native screen recorder with PipeWire audio.
 Records the full screen or a single window to MP4 (H.264, H.265 or AV1),
 encoded in software.
Depends: libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24.0), libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.72.0), libstdc++6 (>= 12), libc6 (>= 2.35), libgstreamer1.0-0 (>= 1.22.0), libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0 (>= 1.22.0), gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, gstreamer1.0-pipewire, libpipewire-0.3-0 (>= 0.3.65), xdg-desktop-portal (>= 1.16.0), xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, libdbus-1-3 (>= 1.12.0), x11-utils
